{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"aa1b925988838e1371bb072e339379f03dcec5f83d41111f9f14f58e31d5e89e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["斥责泰尔王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华的话又临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你对泰尔君王说，主耶和华如此说：",{"text":"因你心里高傲，说：我是神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在海中坐神之位。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你虽然居心自比神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不过是人，并不是神！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看哪，你比但以理更有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"什么秘事都不能向你隐藏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你靠自己的智慧聪明得了金银财宝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收入库中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你靠自己的大智慧和贸易增添资财，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因资财心里高傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以主耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你居心自比神，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使外邦人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是列国中的强暴人临到你这里；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必拔刀砍坏你用智慧得来的美物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亵渎你的荣光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必使你下坑；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必死在海中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与被杀的人一样。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在杀你的人面前你还能说「我是神」吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其实你在杀害你的人手中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不过是人，并不是神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必死在外邦人手中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与未受割礼","poem":1},{"noteId":28},{"text":"的人一样，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为这是主耶和华说的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["泰尔王的终局"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华的话临到我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「人子啊，你为泰尔王作起哀歌，说主耶和华如此说：",{"text":"你无所不备，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧充足，全然美丽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾在伊甸 神的园中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"佩戴各样宝石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是红宝石、红璧玺、金钢石、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"水苍玉、红玛瑙、碧玉、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蓝宝石、绿宝石、红玉，和黄金；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又有精美的鼓笛在你那里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都是在你受造之日预备齐全的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是那受膏遮掩约柜的基路伯；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我将你安置在 神的圣山上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在发光如火的宝石中间往来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你从受造之日所行的都完全，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"后来在你中间又察出不义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你贸易很多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就被强暴的事充满，以致犯罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我因你亵渎圣地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就从 神的山驱逐你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"遮掩约柜的基路伯啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已将你从发光如火的宝石中除灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因美丽心中高傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又因荣光败坏智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已将你摔倒在地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你倒在君王面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫他们目睹眼见。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因罪孽众多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"贸易不公，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就亵渎你那里的圣所。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"故此，我使火从你中间发出，烧灭你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你在所有观看的人眼前变为地上的炉灰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各国民中，凡认识你的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都必为你惊奇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你令人惊恐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再存留于世，直到永远。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["斥责西顿"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"耶和华的话临到我说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"「人子啊，你要向西顿预言攻击她，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"说主耶和华如此说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"西顿哪，我与你为敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在你中间得荣耀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在你中间施行审判、显为圣的时候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人就知道我是耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使瘟疫进入西顿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使血流在她街上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被杀的必在其中仆倒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"四围有刀剑临到她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人就知道我是耶和华。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列要蒙福"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["「四围恨恶以色列家的人，必不再向他们作刺人的荆棘，伤人的蒺藜，人就知道我是主耶和华。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["主耶和华如此说：「我将分散在万民中的以色列家招聚回来，向他们在列邦人眼前显为圣的时候，他们就在我赐给我仆人雅各之地，仍然居住。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["他们要在这地上安然居住。我向四围恨恶他们的众人施行审判以后，他们要盖造房屋，栽种葡萄园，安然居住，就知道我是耶和华—他们的 神。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":28,"caller":"-","text":"或译：不洁；下同","reference":{"chapter":28,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/EZK/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}